    "sections": {
        "description": "The Goods and Transport Theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for presenting transport-related content, logistics information, shipping services, fleet details, and business updates. It includes organized sections for service listings, featured content, contact information, testimonials, and company details. The homepage layout supports banners, call-to-action areas, and content blocks that help arrange information in a clear format. The theme offers responsive layouts that adapt across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices for a consistent browsing experience. It supports customization through the built-in editor, allowing changes to colors, typography, menus, logos, and page layouts without modifying core files. The code follows standard development practices, making it compatible with commonly used plugins and regular platform updates. It also includes support for navigation menus, widget areas, featured images, and blog sections for publishing company news or industry articles. Basic SEO-friendly structure, optimized page layouts, and accessibility-focused elements contribute to improved usability. Overall, the Goods and Transport Theme provides a balanced framework for creating an organized and informative website with flexible customization options while maintaining a clean and professional appearance."
    },
